---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Bush Gums"
  description="How the Bush Gums website handles information."
  noindex
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>What happens to your information.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This MVP does not ask you to create an account or join a mailing list.
      </p>
      <h2>Website and demand analytics</h2><p>
        Bush Gums records limited first-party website interactions to improve
        recommendations and understand what hiking gear visitors are looking
        for. These can include the page and traffic source or campaign, kit and
        product interactions, merchant-link clicks, Build My Kit progress and
        result, and the six choices made in Build My Kit: broad hiking location,
        intended season, solo or two-person shelter, budget range, cost, comfort
        or lightweight priority, and overnight-hiking experience.
      </p><p>
        We use this information to provide and improve kit recommendations,
        understand demand and desired price points, identify unmet gear needs,
        decide what products and categories to research, improve navigation and
        content, and understand which traffic sources produce useful engagement.
        The first-party dataset does not intentionally contain names, email
        addresses, phone numbers, exact addresses or locations, account IDs,
        payment information or arbitrary free-text answers.
      </p><p>
        Cloudflare may also add a coarse two-letter request country, such as AU
        or NZ, to an event. Bush Gums does not store city, postcode, precise
        location or IP address in this dataset.
      </p><p>
        A random identifier stored only for the current browser-tab session can
        connect traffic source, questionnaire, product and merchant interactions
        during that session. It is not stored in a cookie or used to create a
        persistent visitor profile. Event data is processed in Cloudflare
        Workers Analytics Engine, which Cloudflare states retains data for three
        months. The first-party tracker honours browser Do Not Track and Global
        Privacy Control signals.
      </p>
      <h2>Microsoft Clarity</h2><p>
        Bush Gums uses Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors interact
        with most pages through heatmaps, session recordings and interaction
        patterns such as clicks, scrolling and navigation. Clarity is separate
        from the structured first-party analytics above and does not run on the
        Build My Kit page. Bush Gums does not send questionnaire answer values
        to Clarity custom tags or identity APIs. Clarity may set cookies with a
        pseudonymous identifier. Microsoft processes this information under its
        own <a href="https://www.microsoft.com/privacy/privacystatement"
          >privacy terms</a
        >. Microsoft says it retains recording playback for 30 days, or up to
        nine months for labelled or favourited sessions. It retains click and
        heatmap data for nine months.
      </p>
      <h2>External merchant links</h2><p>
        When you follow a merchant or affiliate link, the external merchant and
        any affiliate network may receive information about that visit and may
        use their own cookies or tracking. Where a network supports it, Bush
        Gums may attach a non-personal placement identifier to understand which
        recommendations generate merchant visits or affiliate-network purchases.
        Bush Gums does not infer that a merchant click became a sale; purchase
        and commission reporting comes from the affiliate network. Review the
        external merchant's privacy terms before purchasing.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact emails</h2><p>
        If you email Bush Gums, your message and address are handled by the
        configured email provider so we can respond. Do not include sensitive
        information that is not needed for your question.
      </p>
      <h2>What this site does not do</h2><p>
        This MVP has no account system, active email capture, checkout, customer
        database or persistent first-party visitor identifier. External merchant
        and affiliate tracking, Clarity and Bush Gums' structured analytics are
        separate systems.
      </p>
      <p class="small-print">Last reviewed: 19 September 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
